          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekirukuleeta enyahukana ha bintu ebirukuzirwa kandi ekirukwahukaniza ebihangwa ebyomeezi ebirukwikirizibwa kuliibwa n'ebihangwa ebyomeezi ebitarukwikirizibwa kuliibwa.",
